@startuml swizzled-ptr
' ============================================================================
' swizzled-ptr.puml — the SwizzledPtr 64-bit state word (bit layout + states).
' Source of truth: src/persistent_artrie/core/swizzled_ptr.rs (SwizzledPtr).
' Drawn as a CONTIGUOUS colored bit table (bit-range column + field column, MSB→LSB)
' hosted in a floating note; rows share borders (no gaps). The atomic states are
' preserved as a text block below the table. Full-cell color via Creole |<#hex>| cells.
' Color key:  amber #FFE0B2  tag / flags bits · blue #BBDEFB  on-disk location fields
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam TitleFontSize 15
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #37474F
}

title SwizzledPtr — one 64-bit word: an in-memory pointer OR an on-disk location

note as SP
|= bits |= field |
|<#FFE0B2> 63 |<#FFE0B2> tag  (MSB: in-memory vs on-disk) |
|<#BBDEFB> 62..40 |<#BBDEFB> block_id  (23 bits) |
|<#BBDEFB> 39..18 |<#BBDEFB> location  (22 bits, offset in block) |
|<#FFE0B2> 17..0 |<#FFE0B2> flags  (18 bits) |

**States** (atomic transitions):
null · MEMORY (resident ptr) · INSTALLING (faulting in)
EVICTING (unswizzling) · on-disk (block_id, location)
end note

legend bottom
| Color | Field |
|<#FFE0B2>| tag / flags bits |
|<#BBDEFB>| on-disk location fields (block_id · location) |
endlegend
@enduml
